oPOS is a fast, offline-first point-of-sale and customer-credit (khata / udhaar) app built for small shops and retailers. Bill customers in seconds, track your stock, and keep every customer's credit balance straight — no internet required, and no ads.\n\nWHY SHOPKEEPERS CHOOSE RHINOPOS\n• Lightning-fast billing — ring up a sale in seconds.\n• Built-in Khata / Udhaar ledger — track who owes what, due dates, partial payments, and running balances per customer.\n• Inventory with low-stock alerts — know what's running out before it does.\n• Receipts your way — print, or share as PDF or on WhatsApp.\n• Barcode scanning — scan to add items and ring up sales fast.\n• Works 100% offline — your data lives on your device.\n• Private & secure — local encrypted storage, with an optional PIN and fingerprint / Face ID lock.\n• No ads. Ever.\n\nFREE TO USE\nThe core point-of-sale and the full khata ledger are free — fast billing, inventory, receipts, customer credit, and local backup.\n\nRHINOPOS PRO\nPower-ups for growing shops: advanced reports and full history, staff accounts with roles, and professional branded receipts with your own logo. New users get a 60-day Pro trial.\n\nMade for kiryana / general stores, pharmacies, mobile shops, and any small retailer who wants a simple, reliable till and udhaar book in one app.\n\nIMPORTANT — YOUR DATA & BACKUPS\nRhinoPOS stores your data only on this device and does not automatically sync to the cloud. If you delete the app, switch phones, or lose your device, your data cannot be recovered unless you have made a backup. Please use the built-in Backup feature regularly and keep your backup file somewhere safe. If you set a backup password, store it carefully — an encrypted backup cannot be opened without it. (Automatic cloud backup is planned for a future update.)\n\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.haywiredtech.com/rhinopos/privacy/\nTerms of Service: https://www.haywiredtech.com/rhinopos/terms/\nTerms of Use (EULA): https://www.apple.com